  "title": "Honey Garlic Moose Meatballs",
  "description": "Have a ton of ground moose just begging to be used up? Try this recipe for sweet and spicy moose meatballs and for a tasty conversation starter at your next cocktail party.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristen Rose"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-06-04T09:43:32-04:00",
